    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You are lethal when using ranged weapons against adjacent targets.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Point-Blank_Shot\" title=\"Point-Blank Shot\">Point-Blank Shot</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> When firing a ranged weapon at a target within or adjacent to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fighting_Space\" title=\"Fighting Space\">Fighting Space</a>, you gain a +1 bonus on the attack roll and deal +1 die of damage on a hit.</p><p><b>Special:</b> The effects of this Feat do not stack with the extra damage provided by the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Burst_Fire\" title=\"Burst Fire\">Burst Fire</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rapid_Shot\" title=\"Rapid Shot\">Rapid Shot</a> Feats. This Feat does not apply to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Heavy_Weapons\" title=\"Heavy Weapons\">Heavy Weapons</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicle_Weapons\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vehicle Weapons\">Vehicle Weapons</a>, or in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicle_Combat\" title=\"Vehicle Combat\">Vehicle Combat</a>.</p>",
